# Content holds (src/lib/carddex/pair-designs.ts HELD_PAIR_DESIGNS): a held identity design's files stay in the repo
# but are never uploaded or served (wrangler reads this file in the assets folder; vite copies it from public/).
# No release offered these designs, so no stored coin carries one; never list a design a release has offered. One line
# per held design: delete it with its HELD_PAIR_DESIGNS line to publish the design again (tests/carddex/held-assets.test.ts).
pair-agency[-.]*
pair-alon[-.]*
pair-jeanphil[-.]*
pair-claudia[-.]*
pair-biketyson[-.]*
pair-neet[-.]*
pair-ansem[-.]*
pair-spx[-.]*
pair-vine[-.]*
